# Translation of the Museum of Alternative Displays into Español.
# How to work on this file: TRANSLATING.md at the top of the repository.
# 
# Español. The Spanish of Spain, with the visitor addressed as "tú".
# A display with a picture surface is a "pantalla", a readout of fixed segments is a "visualizador", a board is a "panel".
# The room every piece stands in is "la habitación", so that "sala" stays free for the seven halls.
