msgstr "Película recortada a {n} segundos, sin sonido, recodificada"

#: archive
#. What was done to an archive picture or film before it was put on the site.
msgctxt "changes.4"
msgid "Cropped, marks from the rest of the sheet painted out, resized"
msgstr "Imagen recortada, con las marcas del resto de la hoja borradas, y redimensionada"

#: archive
#. What was done to an archive picture or film before it was put on the site.
msgctxt "changes.5"
